{"hw":"σφόδρα","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">σφόδρα</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">σφόδρ-α</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span>, properly neut. pl. of <span class=\"gk\">σφοδρός</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">very much, exceedingly</b>: </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">I</span> with Verbs, <span class=\"gk\">ἐμήδιζον γὰρ ς</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.17</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ς. ἱμείρουσα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">El.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1053</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">καὶ ς. πείθει</span> persuades them <b class=\"lex-tr\">too well</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">150</span> </span> (anap.); <span class=\"gk\">ς. λέγειν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">with vehemence</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.15</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ς. κολάζειν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">severely</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.46</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ς. ὁρίσασθαι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">exactly</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">263d</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phlb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">58d</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">68a</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">73a</spa